@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
participant "Student / Browser" as Browser
participant "React client" as React
participant "Azure Functions" as Functions
participant "C# Messages SDK" as Sdk
participant "Claude API" as Claude
Browser -> React : 1. Run prompt
React -> Functions : 2. POST /api/agent/stream
Functions -> Functions : 3. Validate bounded JSON input
Functions -> Sdk : 4. Delegate HTTP trigger
Sdk -> Claude : 5. Create streaming model request
Claude -> Sdk : 6. Receive SDK stream chunks
loop streamed text and application updates
Sdk -> Functions : 7. Project safe text delta
Functions -> React : 8. Write UTF-8 SSE event
React -> React : 9. Update React answer and timeline
end
alt complete
Sdk -> Functions : 10. Aggregate result and usage
React -> React : 11. Dispatch final result
React -> Browser : 12. Render safe highlighted Markdown
Functions -> React : 13. Complete final result plus done
else failure
Functions -> React : 14. Emit safe stream error
React -> Browser : 15. Show recoverable browser error
else missing key or invalid input
Functions -> React : 16. Reject missing key before inference
end
@enduml
